      en: ["The highest peak is Sveti Jure at 1,762 meters above sea level.", "The Skywalk Biokovo was opened in 2020 at an elevation of 1,228 meters.", "Home to over 1,500 different species of plants.", "Contains more than 400 registered caves and pits.", "The Biokovo bellflower is a prominent endemic plant of the region.", "Populations of chamois and mouflons have been successfully reintroduced."],
      es: ["El pico más alto es el Sveti Jure con 1.762 metros.", "El Skywalk Biokovo se inauguró en 2020 a 1.228 metros.", "Alberga más de 1.500 especies de plantas diferentes.", "Contiene más de 400 objetos espeleológicos registrados.", "La campanilla de Biokovo es un famoso endemismo local.", "En el parque viven gamuzas y muflones reintroducidos con éxito."],
